  "label": "general internet audience",
  "description": "The meme is designed for a broad general internet audience familiar with internet humor, meme culture, and the use of crude, insulting language for comedic effect. The target community includes users who understand and appreciate the juxtaposition of a benign visual (an older man in formal attire) with aggressive text ('shut up you meathead') to create a mocking or humorous reaction. The meme relies on common internet tropes of verbal aggression and stereotyping (specifically the 'meathead' stereotype) to provoke laughter or ridicule, appealing to those who find such crude humor entertaining or relatable within online communities.",
